From dad6b6b8c69af6f0fbd6457ede3dec9e6eec8339 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dirk Chen <dirkchen@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Jan 2026 01:06:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] cpld: Add firmware update support for Lattice XO5-15D

Enable firmware update capability for the Lattice XO5-15D CPLD.
The update flow differs from the Lattice XO5 series and follows
the Lattice Embedded Security and Functional Block (ESFB) specification
to perform firmware updates over the I2C protocol.

Related PR:
entity manager
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/86778

phosphor dbus interfaces
https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/85245

Tested on Anacapa.
'''
